# 编码红线（docs/i18n-encoding-standard.md §2.1）：
# 文本一律 LF 入库，防止 Windows core.autocrlf 与编码探测引入整文件 diff/GBK 污染。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件：禁止 Git 做换行/编码转换
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.otf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.doc binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.wasm binary

# 文档/数据文本：显式声明按文本处理（内容本身必须 UTF-8）
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
